m (ETH) Millionaires Are Changing Their Bets Ethereum (ETH) is trading at below $4,000 currently, which indicates short-term weakness but the bulls are unable to gain control, yet long-term fundamentals are still intact, thus making tactical bets by experienced ETH investors. With immediate resistance at $4,000 and its crucial accumulation zone between $3,000 and $2,600, millionaires are exercising maximum prudence while positioning for the next move, using dips as opportunities to re-accumulate in anticipation of targets higher up towards $8,000–$10,000. This strategy of accumulating reflects a macro strategy of capitalizing on volatility without deviating from Ethereum’s long-term bullish trajectory. As ETH investors branch out and look for alternative high-potential opportunities beyond established networks, attention increasingly is turning to new DeFi crypto initiatives and future-oriented crypto tokens that can be used to enhance legacy positions, and so here is growing interest Mutuum Finance (MUTM) as the next crypto coin to explode. Mutuum Finance as the Best Cryptocurrency to Invest in Now Mutuum Finance (MUTM) is rapidly turning into a top crypto project within the DeFi space and among the top cryptos to buy for the near and long terms. Its presale already stands at Stage 6 and has so far registered robust adoption among the crypto community with a combined total of 17,300+ investors contributing over $17.6 million. They observed that such growing demand and consistent investor confidence position MUTM as a viable contender, supported by real DeFi crypto use cases and solid growth, making it one of the next crypto coin to explode in the decentralized finance market. Currently, over 70% of Phase 6 has already sold out, signaling accelerating demand as investors rush to secure tokens before the next price jump. Once this phase concludes, the MUTM price will rise by 20%, moving closer to the $0.06 launch value. With each stage offering fewer tokens at higher