i', 'URL': 'https://timestabloid.com/pundit-xrp-is-about-to-go-parabolic-to-1000-and-beyond-heres-what-is-happening/', 'SOURCE_ID': 67, 'BODY': 'When financial revolutions occur, they rarely start with retail speculation—they begin with infrastructure. That is the premise behind the latest excitement surrounding XRP, following Ripple’s $1 billion acquisition of GTreasury , a global leader in corporate treasury management. The deal, which has sent ripples across both fintech and crypto communities, is being described by popular X analyst X Finance Bull as the spark that could propel XRP into an entirely new financial orbit, with parabolic potential reaching beyond $1,000. Ripple’s $1 Billion Power Move Ripple’s acquisition of GTreasury, confirmed through multiple industry reports and company statements , represents a significant leap into the institutional liquidity and cash-management sector. GTreasury is no startup—it has been serving more than 1,000 top corporations across 160 countries, managing billions in cash flows daily. This makes it one of the most influential infrastructure providers in the corporate treasury space. By absorbing GTreasury into its ecosystem, Ripple has moved beyond payments and remittances into the very heart of global financial operations . This acquisition effectively places Ripple’s blockchain and liquidity solutions—including its stablecoin RLUSD and the XRP Ledger (XRPL)—at the center of corporate money management systems that operate around the clock. THIS IS WHERE IT BEGINS! $XRP is about to go parabolic to $1,000 and beyond! Ripple just acquired GTreasury for $1B This is a domino that sets off the biggest capital flow event in crypto history Make sure BUY every dips of $XRP ! Here’s what most aren’t seeing pic.twitter.com/6qs5KjKWgp — X Finance Bull (@Xfinancebull) October 16, 2025 The Strategic Importance of GTreasury Integration Corporate treasuries represent the nerve center of global finance. They control liquidity, foreign exchange exposure, short-term investments, and risk management for major corporations. Yet these systems have long relied on outdated infrastructure that limits speed, transparency, and efficiency. GTreasury’s platform already automates and optimizes these functions for Fortune 500 firms, and now, with Ripple’s integration, blockchain technology enters this mix. This combination could fundamentally change how corporations manage capital. Ripple’s on-demand liquidity and tokenization capabilities allow value to move in seconds, replacing the multi-day settlement cycles that dominate legacy banking systems. By embedding RLUSD and XRP into GTreasury’s ecosystem, enterprises could gain the ability to settle cross-border transactions instantly, optimize liquidity in real time, and tokenize assets such as treasuries, bonds, and real-world securities—all within compliance frameworks that GTreasury already upholds. What This Means for XRP Utility and Value If enterprises begin using XRP and RLUSD within their treasury operations, the effect could extend far beyond the crypto market. More institutional transaction volume flowing through the XRP Ledger increases both network activity and token burn rate, which, in turn, enhances scarcity. Additionally, large corporations holding XRP as part of their liquidity reserves could shift the supply-demand dynamics in Ripple’s favor. We are on X, follow us to connect with us :- @TimesTabloid1 — TimesTabloid (@TimesTabloid1) June 15, 2025 X Finance Bull argues that this is the moment when XRP transitions from being a speculative digital asset to a fundamental part of global financial infrastructure. The pundit projects price scenarios ranging from $2–3 in the short term to as high as $1,000 in the long run, should trillions in corporate liquidity eventually move across the ledger. While these projections are highly optimistic, they underscore the transformative potential Ripple now holds within the traditional financial system. Adoption Challenges and Market Reality However, it is important to note that institutional adoption is a gradual process. Integrating Ripple’s blockchain into corporate treasury frameworks will require compliance validation, risk assessments, and internal policy overhauls before full-scale utilization occurs. Furthermore, while this acquisition gives Ripple a clear structural advantage, it may take months or years before meaningful transaction volumes manifest on the ledger. Despite these hurdles, the timing of this move could not be more strategic. With RLUSD now operational and Ripple’s legal battle with the SEC concluded , the company enters this new phase with regulatory clarity and financial strength. These factors make the GTreasury acquisition not just plausible but powerfully positioned to reshape institutional finance. In conclusion, Ripple’s $1 billion GTreasury acquisition is more than an expansion—it is a declaration of intent. By integrating XRP into corporate treasury systems that manage billions daily, Ripple has positioned its technology at the center of real-world financial operations. As X Finance Bull emphasized, this move may mark the start of one of the largest capital-flow transitions in crypto history. Whether XRP ultimately reaches $1,000 remains uncertain, but one thing is undeniable: Ripple has just embedded the XRP Ledger into the backbone of modern finance, and the era of true utility may finally be here. Disclaimer : This content is meant to inform and should not be considered financial advice. The views expressed in this article may include the author’s personal opinions and do not represent Times Tabloid’s opinion. Readers are urged to do in-depth research before making any investment decisions. Any action taken by the reader is strictly at their own risk. Times Tabloid is not responsible for any financial losses. Follow us on Twitter , Facebook , Telegram , and Google News The post Pundit: XRP Is About to Go Parabolic to $1,000 and Beyond. Here’s What Is Happening appeared first on Times Tabloid .', 'KEYWORDS': 'Cryptocurrency|News|Ripple|XRP|XRP Price', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1760810729, 'UPDATED_ON': None, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 67, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'timestabloid', 'NAME': 'TimesTabloid', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/67/default.png', 'URL': 'https://timestabloid.com/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': None, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1760830808, 'CREATED_ON': 1664381507, 'UPDATED_ON': 1673235440}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 58, 'NAME': 'XRP', 'CATEGORY': 'XRP'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 209, 'NAME': 'DIGITAL ASSET TREASURY', 'CATEGORY': 'DIGITAL ASSET TREASURY'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 41, 'NAME': 'REGULATION', 'CATEGORY': 'REGULATION'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 210, 'NAME': 'MACROECONOMICS', 'CATEGORY': 'MACROECONOMICS'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 53335176, 'GUID': 'https://zycrypto.com/?p=111650', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1760810696, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/zycrypto.png', 'TITLE': 'Bitcoin Languishes Under $110K As Spot BTC ETFs Shed $536 Million In Biggest Single-Day Outflow Since Early August', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Brenda Ngari', 'URL': 'https://zycrypto.com/bitcoin-languishes-under-110k-as-spot-btc-etfs-shed-536-million-in-biggest-single-day-outflow-since-early-august/', 'SOURCE_ID': 51, 'BODY': 'The 11 funds recorded $536.4 million in net outflows, marking the sharpest single-day capital flight since August 1.', 'KEYWORDS': 'Bitcoin|Markets|News|Bitcoin News|BTCUSD|BTCUSDC|BTCUSDT|Cryptocurrency News|XBTUSD', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'NEGATIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1760810946, 'UPDATED_ON': None, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 51, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'zycrypto', 'NAME': 'ZyCrypto', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/zycrypto.png', 'URL': 'https://zycrypto.com/category/news/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': None, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1760830813, 'CREATED_ON': 1657730129, 'UPDATED_ON': 1673216359}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 14, 'NAME': 'BTC', 'CATEGORY': 'BTC'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 37, 'NAME': 'MARKET', 'CATEGORY': 'MARKET'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 53335014, 'GUID': 'https://en.coinotag.com/ai-generated-headshots-offer-cheaper-faster-options-for-job-seekers-with-authenticity-concerns-for-recruiters/', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1760810582, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/77/53335014.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'AI-Generated Headshots Offer Cheaper, Faster Options for Job Seekers, with Authenticity Concerns for Recruiters', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Gideon Wolf', 'URL': 'https://en.coinotag.com/ai-generated-headshots-offer-cheaper-faster-options-for-job-seekers-with-authenticity-concerns-for-recruiters/', 'SOURCE_ID': 77, 'BODY': 'Bitcoin ETF approval impact on the crypto market expands regulated exposure for a broader investor base, potentially boosting liquidity and accelerating price discovery. The ultimate effect depends on custody standards,', 'KEYWORDS': 'Analysis|News|BTC', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1760810629, 'UPDATED_ON': 1760810630, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 77, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'coinotag', 'NAME': 'CoinOtag', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/77/default.png', 'URL': 'https://en.coinotag.com/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': None, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1760815239, 'CREATED_ON': 1686819961, 'UPDATED_ON': 1717748924}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 14, 'NAME': 'BTC', 'CATEGORY': 'BTC'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 37, 'NAME': 'MARKET', 'CATEGORY': 'MARKET'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 15, 'NAME': 'BUSINESS', 'CATEGORY': 'BUSINESS'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'TRADING', 'CATEGORY': 'TRADING'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 53335011, 'GUID': 'https://decrypt.co/?p=344845', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1760810466, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/44/53335011.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'Wikipedia Traffic Drops as AI Answers Eat the Free Encyclopedia', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Jose Antonio Lanz', 'URL': 'https://decrypt.co/344845/wikipedia-traffic-drops-ai-answers-eat-free-encyclopedia', 'SOURCE_ID': 44, 'BODY': \"The Wikimedia Foundation revealed an unsettling trend: search engines and chatbots are providing Wikipedia's content directly to users without sending them to the site.\", 'KEYWORDS': 'Artificial Intelligence', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'NEGATIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1760810622, 'UPDATED_ON': 1760810622, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 44, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'decrypt', 'NAME': 'Decrypt', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/decrypt.png', 'URL': 'https://decrypt.co/feed', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': 1521331200, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 57, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1760830801, 'CREATED_ON': 1657730129, 'UPDATED_ON': 1711620560}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 63, 'NAME': 'OTHER', 'CATEGORY': 'OTHER'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 53335370, 'GUID': 'https://www.cryptopolitan.com/?p=839464', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1760810460, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/43/53335370.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'AI headshots surge in popularity as job hunters skip expensive photographers', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Noor Bazmi', 'URL': 'https://www.cryptopolitan.com/ai-headshots-could-be-why-job-seekers-are-getting-attention/', 'SOURCE_ID': 43, 'BODY': 'div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&_pre>div]:border-0.5 [&_pre>div]:border-border-400 [&_.ignore-pre-bg>div]:bg-transparent [&_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8\"> _*]:min-w-0 standard-markdown\"> More people looking for work are ditching expensive photography sessions for AI-generated profile pictures that cost a fraction of the price. Landing a job these days starts with how you look online. A decent profile picture can matter just as much as your resume, but professional photography isn’t cheap. Sessions in America easily run several hundred dollars, pricing out many applicants who need them most. New technology lets people upload casual snapshots and get back polished, professional-looking results without ever visiting a studio. Melanie Fan, who works in growth at Plush, an online shopping platform, still remembers shelling out $200 at Yale for a 15-minute session. “It was really expensive. The process of getting the pictures back, rendering them, looking at which ones I looked the best in, and then sending it back to the photographer for edit,” she told CNBC. Fast and cheap alternatives flood the job market Services like InstaHeadshots, PhotoPacksAI, HeadshotPro, and Aragon AI emerged to solve this problem. They turn out finished images in minutes for under $50. Upload a few selfies, pick a background, done. For Fan, it worked. “After I changed my LinkedIn photo, the amount of inbound I’ve been getting from companies has skyrocketed,” she said . She’s seeing three to four times more messages from potential employers. Canva jumped in recently with its own tool that creates realistic pictures people can tweak and customize. Their research showed 88% of applicants now believe good online photos influence hiring decisions. Up 45% from a year ago. That matches what’s happening across recruitment , 90% of hiring managers have tried using artificial intelligence, and 96% of job hunters using it said they got callbacks. Danny Wu heads AI development at Canva. He says they’re not trying to kill professional photography. “This is just a more accessible way to get professional and unique headshots,” Wu said. Their software swaps backgrounds, moves things around, and adjusts styling. Authenticity concerns rise among recruiters Cheaper access brings questions. Recruiters are watching for photos that seem too polished, worried about candidates being dishonest. Job seekers feel it too. Sam DeMase advises job hunters at ZipRecruiter. He says there’s real risk. Bad AI photos are obvious and make people look fake, which can hurt your chances. But even he admits the technology keeps improving. “It’s becoming more and more difficult to tell whether a headshot has been enhanced or generated by AI,” DeMase said. LinkedIn’s position is simple. Use whatever tools you want, but the photo has to look like you. “Profile photos that don’t comply with our user agreement or professional community policies may be removed,” a company representative said. Gen Z and millennials lead in using these images. Meanwhile,\\xa066% of HR professionals now use AI to write job descriptions, and 44% use it to screen resumes, according to SHRM. As noted by Cryptopolitan in earlier reports, AI keeps reshaping how people find work. Traditional photographers will probably lose business. But for job seekers watching their budgets, these tools offer a fighting chance in a brutal market. Join Bybit now and claim a $50 bonus in minutes', 'KEYWORDS': 'Tech|Aragon AI|HeadshotPro|InstaHeadshots|PhotoPacksAI', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1760811274, 'UPDATED_ON': 1760826226, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 43, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'cryptopolitan', 'NAME': 'Cryptopolitan', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/cryptopolitan.png', 'URL': 'https://www.cryptopolitan.com/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': None, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1760830802, 'CREATED_ON': 1657730129, 'UPDATED_ON': 1681205909}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 49, 'NAME': 'TECHNOLOGY', 'CATEGORY': 'TECHNOLOGY'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 37, 'NAME': 'MARKET', 'CATEGORY': 'MARKET'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'TRADING', 'CATEGORY': 'TRADING'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 15, 'NAME': 'BUSINESS', 'CATEGORY': 'BUSINESS'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 64, 'NAME': 'RESEARCH', 'CATEGORY': 'RESEARCH'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 25, 'NAME': 'EXCHANGE', 'CATEGORY': 'EXCHANGE'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 53334923, 'GUID': 'https://www.newsbtc.com/?p=840019', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1760810450, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/21/53334923.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'Dogecoin Price Set To Go On A 2,000% Cyclical Surge To $4', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Scott Matherson', 'URL': 'https://www.newsbtc.com/altcoin/dogecoin-price-set-to-go-on-a-2000-cyclical-surge-to-4/', 'SOURCE_ID': 21, 'BODY': 'The Dogecoin price could be gearing up for an explosive move soon, as technical analysts suggest that the popular meme coin may be entering another parabolic cycle. While the broader crypto market declines, analysts believe Dogecoin’s historical patterns and price structures are setting the stage for a potential 2,000% rally that could see it soar as high as $4 by next year. Related Reading: Bitcoin Plunges To $105k As Investors Shift To Gold After Crypto Carnage Dogecoin Price To Mirror Pre-2017 Explosive Surge Crypto analyst Javon Marks has indicated that Dogecoin’s price action is closely mirroring the bullish setup that preceded its historic price rally in 2017. If this pattern continues, he predicts that the cryptocurrency may be preparing for its next cyclical surge to new all-time highs and beyond. Marks points out that Dogecoin’s long-term structure is forming a massive cup-shaped base, which historically has paved the way for significant bull runs. His analysis forecasts a minimum 251% increase in the near term, with a potential 2,000% surge over a longer timeframe, should the historical pattern unfold as it did in the past. The analyst’s accompanying chart illustrates a recurring accumulation pattern where Dogecoin consolidates for years before breaking out sharply. The price history between 2014 and 2017 is being mirrored by the 2022 – 2025 formation, where the meme coin appears to be carving out a rounded bottom and a consolidation triangle. Once price action completes this structure, Marks predicts that a breakout toward $4 is technically possible. Notably, Dogecoin’s resilience between its current price at $0.18 and $0.3 may act as a launchpad for the next parabolic phase, especially if the overall market sentiment turns bullish in 2026. As of the time of writing, CoinMarketCap’s data indicates that the meme coin’s price has increased by 5.53% over the past 24 hours, marking a slight recovery from its monthly decline of over 33%. Analysts Share Different Outlooks For Dogecoin A separate analysis by market experts presents a slightly different outlook for Dogecoin, with one expert expecting a moderate price surge and another predicting a potential breakdown. Crypto analyst Ali Martinez views Dogecoin’s current structure as part of a steady, upward-trending price channel. He highlighted that DOGE continues to trade within an ascending range established since early 2023. This framework implies that the meme coin remains technically bullish despite short-term corrections. In his analysis, Martinez identifies moderate but critical upside checkpoints at $0.29, $0.45, and $0.86, based on the Fibonacci retracement and extension levels. His chart illustrates how Dogecoin has repeatedly bounced off the lower boundary of the channel, mostly near $0.18, indicating strong buyer interest in that zone. Notably, the analyst forecasts that a rebound from this area could set the stage for gradual advances toward $1 in the coming months. Market expert Bitguru adds a note of caution, observing that the $0.18 – $0.19 region is acting as a make-or-break level for bulls. A decisive drop below it could expose Dogecoin’s price to a deeper retracement toward $0.095. The analyst advises traders to remain vigilant, noting that DOGE still appears to be in a corrective phase. Related Reading: Biggest Shiba Inu Burn In Months — And It Came From A Coinbase Account Featured image from Unsplash, chart from TradingView', 'KEYWORDS': 'Altcoin|altcoins|crypto|crypto market|crypto news|cryptocurrency|doge|Dogecoin|dogeusd|meme coins', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1760810508, 'UPDATED_ON': 1760810508, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 21, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'newsbtc', 'NAME': 'NewsBTC', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/newsbtc.png', 'URL': 'https://www.newsbtc.com/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': 1380585600, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 50, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1760830790, 'CREATED_ON': 1657730129, 'UPDATED_ON': 1711620962}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'TRADING', 'CATEGORY': 'TRADING'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 20, 'NAME': 'DOGE', 'CATEGORY': 'DOGE'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 37, 'NAME': 'MARKET', 'CATEGORY': 'MARKET'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 5, 'NAME': 'ALTCOIN', 'CATEGORY': 'ALTCOIN'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 53334927, 'GUID': '609159', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1760810443, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/13/53334927.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'Bitcoin Price Wedged Between 2 Crucial levels — What To Expect In Coming Days', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Opeyemi Sule', 'URL': 'https://bitcoinist.com/bitcoin-price-between-crucial-levels-what-to-expect/', 'SOURCE_ID': 13, 'BODY': 'Despite the red-hot start to the month, the historically bullish “Uptober” period has not particularly gone according to the expectations for the Bitcoin price. Following the market-wide downturn on October 10, the premier cryptocurrency has not been able to mount a clear recovery back to its former highs. In fact, the Bitcoin price action continues to struggle under lasting bearish pressure, falling to a new low around $103,000 on Friday, October 18. With uncertainty taking over the market, investors are left wondering whether the bull run is over or the sluggish action is a minor blip. According to a recent outlook, the current technical position of the BTC price could offer insight into its next step. BTC At Risk Of Deeper Correction If It Loses $99,900 Support In an October 17 post on the social media platform X, Glassnode put forward an interesting evaluation of the current Bitcoin price setup. The prominent crypto analytics firm revealed that the flagship cryptocurrency is currently sitting between two major support zones. This analysis is based on the Glassnode Technical Pricing Model, a chart containing a number of technical indicators, including the Pi Cycle indicator, the Mayer Multiple, the Yearly Moving Average (MA), and the 200-Week Moving Average. According to Glassnode, the Bitcoin price is currently wedged between the Mayer Multiple ($107,400) and the Yearly MA ($99,900). The Mayer Multiple (200-Day Simple Moving Average) is a popular technical indicator often linked with the transition point between a bull and bear market. Meanwhile, the 365 Day SMA offers a long-standing baseline for high-timeframe market momentum. Following the latest dip, the Bitcoin price slipped beneath the 200-day Moving Average, signaling a possible shift from a bullish market condition to a bearish one. While BTC still holds above the 365-day MA, the premier cryptocurrency needs to stay above this level to steady the current trend. Ultimately, investors might want to keep an eye on the BTC price, as a break beneath the $99,900 level could spell much bigger trouble for the world’s largest cryptocurrency. It is worth noting that a return to above the Mayer Multiple could be significant for Bitcoin’s progression , albeit with price resistance around the 111-day moving average (currently at $114,700). Bitcoin Price At A Glance As of this writing, Bitcoin is valued at around $106,427, reflecting an almost 2% price drop in the past 24 hours.', 'KEYWORDS': 'Bitcoin|bitcoin|bitcoin news|bitcoin price|btc|btc price|BTCUSDT', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'NEGATIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1760810509, 'UPDATED_ON': 1760810509, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 13, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'bitcoinist', 'NAME': 'Bitcoinist', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/bitcoinist.png', 'URL': 'https://bitcoinist.com/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': 1387843200, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 48, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1760830791, 'CREATED_ON': 1657730129, 'UPDATED_ON': 1711620995}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'TRADING', 'CATEGORY': 'TRADING'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 14, 'NAME': 'BTC', 'CATEGORY': 'BTC'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 37, 'NAME': 'MARKET', 'CATEGORY': 'MARKET'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 15, 'NAME': 'BUSINESS', 'CATEGORY': 'BUSINESS'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 53334952, 'GUID': 'https:/